    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to \"find a path forward\" when there's nothing to walk toward. it's like we were two parts of one whole person. now that he's gone, that whole part of me is just dead. i feel like i'm just waiting for my body to catch up to the fact that he's gone. everything is just so empty.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
